  95     // FPR restore (requires mstatus.FS enabled above): one abstract register
  96     // write per f-reg. Abstract-only by design, like every non-V register
  97     // block -- the Program Buffer is reserved for state the abstract command
  98     // space cannot reach (the V regfile, vtype/vl, L2C MMIO).
